cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Nonsense-mediated decay in human lung cells — analysis code"
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper. If you use the data, please also cite the
  Zenodo archive it comes from.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a long-read RNA sequencing study of nonsense-mediated decay (NMD) in four
  human lung cell types, including the neural network that predicts NMD sensitivity from the
  sequence around a transcript's start and stop codons.
